{"id":"n28418-1-6","stage":2,"title":"지적 · 指出","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28418-1-6-1","ko":"누가 너를 때렸는지 손으로 지적을 해 보아라.","zh":"用手指指出来，是谁打了你。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"누가","meaning":"谁都，无论是谁","explanation":"누구：谁都，无论是谁；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"2","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"누가","audio":"/audio/5f79add5f3f77de14a3d.mp3"}},{"text":"너를","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너를","audio":"/audio/439e524cbf5378e2d47a.mp3"}},{"text":"때렸는지","meaning":"打，揍，抽","explanation":"때리다：打，揍，抽；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"때리다","audio":"/audio/97474f90b9c0f4d70878.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14433","senseId":"1","lemma":"때리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때렸는지","audio":"/audio/34f95be92c7f9259a289.mp3"}},{"text":"손으로","meaning":"手指","explanation":"손：手指；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"2","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손으로","audio":"/audio/76c1e0d34bb2dfa1de41.mp3"}},{"text":"지적을","meaning":"指出，指点","explanation":"지적：指出，指点；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지적","audio":"/audio/b0c373a7418c7255f1bc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28418","senseId":"1","lemma":"지적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지적을","audio":"/audio/00b698ef44b55a900fc0.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"보아라.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보아라","audio":"/audio/3743aa3056e98a800a0b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁都，无论是谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指尚未确定的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"97474f90b9c0f4d7","term":"때리다","zh":"打，揍，抽","audio":"/audio/97474f90b9c0f4d70878.mp3","entryId":"14433","definition":"用手或手中的东西狠狠地打击。","pronunciation":["때리다"]},{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手指","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"末端分为五个部分的人的身体部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"b0c373a7418c7255","term":"지적","zh":"指出，指点","audio":"/audio/b0c373a7418c7255f1bc.mp3","entryId":"28418","definition":"明确地点出什么。","pronunciation":["지적"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2a42670dca4b5ec5a5f2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28418-1-6-2","ko":"바로 저 사람이에요.","zh":"就是那个人啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"바로","meaning":"正，就","explanation":"바로：正，就","readings":[{"term":"바로","audio":"/audio/a441b444c56119c0f154.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64744","senseId":"6","lemma":"바로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chi